1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,700
Choose a Source folder. Saved Sources and autocomplete make frequent folders quick to reopen.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:11,500
Use Type, Extension, Name, Age and Size filters to narrow the inbox.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:18,000
Select a file and preview it before changing anything. PDFs support Fit, zoom and page navigation.

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,800
Give the file a clear Name. Rename helpers and templates change only the proposed name.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Choose a Destination alias or path. The full destination stays visible before you commit.

6
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:38,500
Press Rename + Move + Next. DCM files it away and loads the next item.

7
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:43,800
Processed keeps durable history. Select a transaction and Undo it if needed.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Recovery protects interrupted work; Learning can suggest names and destinations locally.
